commit 1314b4bcb9ed7967c4cc7773790e60c6f0c316fc (parent 422915e2c597ce264f474186b7d08d42d59fa29a)

Experiment: the stop without its sweep and wait, every other CPU answering from Ring 0

Not for landing as it stands: the check the stop's removal rests on, run
before anything is deleted. `quiesce::stop` opens the gate, demands a pass of
every other CPU through its doorbell and returns once each has begun one; it
sweeps nothing and waits for no thread. The record is written with zero
threads and zero sweeps so its readers still find a line.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>


